GXEMUL-SEC/tools/pipeline/ledger.json-17451-     "date": "2026-08-22",
GXEMUL-SEC/tools/pipeline/ledger.json-17452-     "note": "Pre-existing; sh4prio0 makes it reachable rather than fatal, which is why it is filed in the same breath. Natural completion is the :343-351 rescan at the end of the recompute -- a second design question, its own round."
GXEMUL-SEC/tools/pipeline/ledger.json-17453-    }
