GXEMUL-SEC/tools/pipeline/ledger.json-17957-   "state_note": "  *** DISPOSITION 2026-08-24 (fable5 queue ranking): DROP FROM THE ACTIONABLE QUEUE, KEEP AS A RECORD. *** Two seats independently refuse to settle it and the row's own entry says neither claim is settleable in this tree. **A defect that cannot be reproduced cannot be test-first'd, and a round that cannot be test-first'd is not a round** -- it is a document, which the witness ladder already says plainly ('no witness at rung 2-4 -> document instead, stop'). Converted to: *assessed, cannot settle without an external SH3/SH4 identity source*. RE-OPEN ONLY if such documentation is obtained -- and that is not hypothetical, because obtaining the SH7750 manual on 2026-08-22 settled an SH question in the same session it was raised and refuted a finding this project was about to file."
