Two titles need qualification already: the SH priority detector has gained checks since the “four slots” claim, and the harness does exercise TMU behavior on Landisk despite the synthetic machines being clockless. I’m also tracing SH-4 device ownership; the constructor no longer matches the spelling quoted in the old row.
