#  TWICE -- by one file, then by five.  Stale in the harmful direction: touching an unlisted
#  ARC/Jazz file made check A hard-fail and instruct the operator to OVERWRITE THE SEC-ONLY
#  ARC LAYER with est/'s version.  And a path listed here but NOT actually divergent
